{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
BRAND FONTS: CANELA AND GRAPHIK (Corvo addition)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The type of Corvo, as set by the owner on 20 November (spec sheet, "Fonts"). Two families from one foundry:

  Cover lines, main messages, collection openers   Canela Light          large, sentence case
  Titles, rug names, quotes                        Canela Deck Regular   sentence case
  Lead paragraphs                                  Canela Text Regular   italic for emphasis
  Body text, captions, footers, specs, prices      Graphik Regular       16 px, line spacing 1.5, figures of one width
  Labels and overlines                             Graphik Semibold      capitals, letterspaced
  Buttons and totals                               Graphik Medium
  The wordmark                                     the logo file         never typed

The font files are read from Shopify (Content > Files) by their names, below. The files there today are the foundry's
trial versions: they are meant for trying the fonts, carry no accents and few signs (no € × : / & %), and are therefore
used in theme previews only. On the published theme the fonts of the theme settings stay in place until the licensed
files are uploaded and their names written below (the names then lose "-Trial"). A sign a font lacks is drawn by the
next font in its list, a similar system font.

Parameters:
* part: "state" prints "on" when the brand fonts are in use, "preload" prints the preload links of the two most used
  files, anything else prints the font faces and the styles. The layout renders the styles after the theme's own.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign file_display = 'Canela-Light-Trial.otf'
  assign file_display_italic = 'Canela-LightItalic-Trial.otf'
  assign file_title = 'CanelaDeck-Regular-Trial.otf'
  assign file_title_italic = 'CanelaDeck-RegularItalic-Trial.otf'
  assign file_lead = 'CanelaText-Regular-Trial.otf'
  assign file_lead_italic = 'CanelaText-RegularItalic-Trial.otf'
  assign file_text = 'Graphik-Regular-Trial.otf'
  assign file_text_italic = 'Graphik-RegularItalic-Trial.otf'
  assign file_text_medium = 'Graphik-Medium-Trial.otf'
  assign file_text_semibold = 'Graphik-Semibold-Trial.otf'

  assign brand_fonts_on = false

  if settings.brand_fonts
    assign brand_fonts_on = true
  endif

  if file_text contains '-Trial' and theme.role == 'main'
    assign brand_fonts_on = false
  endif
-%}

{%- if part == 'state' -%}
  {%- if brand_fonts_on -%}on{%- endif -%}
{%- elsif brand_fonts_on -%}
  {%- if part == 'preload' -%}
    {%- assign preload_files = file_text | append: '|' | append: file_title | split: '|' -%}

    {%- for preload_file in preload_files -%}
      {%- assign preload_type = 'font/otf' -%}
      {%- if preload_file contains '.woff2' -%}{%- assign preload_type = 'font/woff2' -%}{%- endif -%}
      <link rel="preload" href="{{ preload_file | file_url }}" as="font" type="{{ preload_type }}" crossorigin>
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- else -%}
    {%- capture font_faces -%}
      Canela|300|normal|{{ file_display }};
      Canela|300|italic|{{ file_display_italic }};
      Canela Deck|400|normal|{{ file_title }};
      Canela Deck|400|italic|{{ file_title_italic }};
      Canela Text|400|normal|{{ file_lead }};
      Canela Text|400|italic|{{ file_lead_italic }};
      Graphik|400|normal|{{ file_text }};
      Graphik|400|italic|{{ file_text_italic }};
      Graphik|500|normal|{{ file_text_medium }};
      Graphik|600|normal|{{ file_text_semibold }}
    {%- endcapture -%}

    {%- assign font_face_list = font_faces | split: ';' -%}

    <style>
      {%- for font_face in font_face_list -%}
        {%- assign face = font_face | strip | split: '|' -%}
        {%- assign face_file = face[3] | strip -%}
        {%- assign face_format = 'opentype' -%}
        {%- if face_file contains '.woff2' -%}
          {%- assign face_format = 'woff2' -%}
        {%- elsif face_file contains '.woff' -%}
          {%- assign face_format = 'woff' -%}
        {%- elsif face_file contains '.ttf' -%}
          {%- assign face_format = 'truetype' -%}
        {%- endif -%}
        @font-face {
          font-family: "{{ face[0] | strip }}";
          src: url("{{ face_file | file_url }}") format("{{ face_format }}");
          font-weight: {{ face[1] }};
          font-style: {{ face[2] }};
          font-display: swap;
        }
      {%- endfor -%}

      :root {
        --display-font-family: "Canela", "Canela Deck", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --display-font-weight: 300;
        --heading-font-family: "Canela Deck", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --heading-font-weight: 400;
        --heading-font-style: normal;
        --heading-text-transform: none;
        --heading-letter-spacing: 0em;
        --lead-font-family: "Canela Text", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        --text-font-family: "Graphik", "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        --text-font-weight: 400;
        --text-font-style: normal;
        --text-letter-spacing: 0em;
        --label-letter-spacing: .12em;
        --button-font: normal 500 var(--text-sm) / 1.65 var(--text-font-family);
        --button-letter-spacing: .12em;

        /* Text of 16 px, the sizes around it two pixels up from the theme's */
        --text-xs: .8125rem;
        --text-sm: .875rem;
        --text-base: 1rem;
        --text-lg: 1.125rem;
        --text-xl: 1.25rem;

        /* Titles in sentence case read smaller than in capitals: a larger scale, from a phone (375 px) to a computer (1400 px) */
        --text-h1: clamp(2rem, 1.634rem + 1.561vw, 3rem);
        --text-h2: clamp(1.75rem, 1.476rem + 1.171vw, 2.5rem);
        --text-h3: clamp(1.375rem, 1.238rem + .585vw, 1.75rem);
        --text-h4: clamp(1.125rem, 1.034rem + .39vw, 1.375rem);
        --text-h5: 1.125rem;
        --text-h6: .75rem;
      }

      /* Body text: line spacing 1.5 */
      html body {
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Titles: Canela Deck, with closer lines */
      html :is(.h1, .h2), html .prose :is(h1, h2) {
        line-height: 1.15;
      }

      html :is(.h3, .h4), html .prose :is(h3, h4) {
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      html .h5, html .prose h5 {
        line-height: 1.35;
      }

      @media screen and (min-width: 700px) {
        html :is(.sm\:h1, .sm\:h2) {
          line-height: 1.15;
        }

        html :is(.sm\:h3, .sm\:h4) {
          line-height: 1.25;
        }

        html .sm\:h5 {
          line-height: 1.35;
        }
      }

      /* Cover lines, main messages, collection openers: Canela Light, large */
      html :is(.hero-films__heading, .cshow__title, .pfolio__title, .page-figures__value, .page-timeline__year),
      html :is(.page-intro, .collection-banner) h1 {
        font-family: var(--display-font-family);
        font-weight: var(--display-font-weight);
        letter-spacing: -.01em;
        line-height: 1.1;
      }

      html :is(.page-intro, .collection-banner) h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 2.043rem + 1.951vw, 4rem);
      }

      /* The home's opening line, larger on a phone, where it now takes two lines */
      html .hero-films__heading {
        font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 1.75rem + 2.6vw, 4.5rem);
      }

      /* Lead paragraphs: Canela Text */
      html :is(.page-intro__lead, .hero-films__text, .cshow__description, .pfolio__lede, .designer__summary, .collection-banner .collection-description),
      html .section-header .prose > p:not([class]) {
        font-family: var(--lead-font-family);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.017rem + .195vw, 1.1875rem);
        line-height: 1.5;
        letter-spacing: 0;
      }

      /* Quotes: Canela Deck */
      html .prose blockquote {
        font-family: var(--heading-font-family);
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* Labels and overlines: Graphik Semibold, capitals, letterspaced */
      html :is(.h6, th, .badge, .smallcaps, .page-figures__label, .page-quote__by), html .prose h6, html .heading.text-xxs {
        font-family: var(--text-font-family);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-style: normal;
        letter-spacing: var(--label-letter-spacing);
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      html .smallcaps {
        font-size: .6875rem;
      }

      /* Rug names: Canela Deck */
      html .product-title {
        font-family: var(--heading-font-family);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-style: normal;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      html .product-card .product-title {
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 1.125rem;
        line-height: 1.3;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      /* Designer names: Canela Deck, like rug names */
      html .designer-card__name {
        font-family: var(--heading-font-family);
        font-weight: 400;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        line-height: 1.25;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        text-transform: none;
      }

      @media screen and (max-width: 699px) {
        html .product-card .product-title {
          font-size: 1rem;
          letter-spacing: 0;
        }
      }

      /* Specs, tables and prices: figures of one width (a feature of the licensed files; the trial versions lack it) */
      html :is(sale-price, compare-at-price, unit-price, .price-list, .rug-steps, .rug-summary, table, .spec-sheet) {
        font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
      }

      /* Totals: Graphik Medium */
      html .rug-summary__total {
        font-weight: 500;
      }

      /* The line under a tab of the menu is measured on the tab's own words */
      html .header__primary-nav-item:before {
        font-family: var(--text-font-family);
        font-weight: var(--text-font-weight);
        font-size: inherit;
        letter-spacing: var(--text-letter-spacing);
        text-transform: none;
      }

      /* The menu from 1150 to 1279 px: closer tabs, so that the six hold on one line beside the button */
      @media screen and (min-width: 1150px) and (max-width: 1279px) {
        html .header__primary-nav {
          column-gap: 1.75rem;
        }
      }

      /* The filters of the rug lists: a size down, so that the longer names hold on one line */
      html .rug-filters {
        font-size: var(--text-sm);
      }

      /* Fields keep the text font */
      html .header-search__input {
        font-family: var(--text-font-family);
      }
    </style>
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}
